card c03
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Parent and daughter
figure: parent-daughter
figure_at: 1

body:
    Scientists give the two nuclei names. The nucleus that changes is the [[parent-nuclide|parent]]. The nucleus it becomes is the [[daughter-nuclide|daughter]]. The change gives off radiation, and that radiation is what comes out.

