card c07
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Random for one, regular for many
figure: random-one
figure_at: 2

body:
    You can say that a nucleus has a chance of changing. You cannot say when. Watch one nucleus and its moment is a surprise, and no nucleus ever gets 'due'. A whole group is different, and the next lessons show how.

